    "name": "Highreach",
    "steam_appid": 2620450,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the lost world of Highreach, a once-great continent now fractured and floating under a veil of ancient, dangerous magic that alters the very fabric of reality.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/8713ad006e366c2ca43962530b87fcb4.poster.avif?t=1754665151\" width=800 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/8713ad006e366c2ca43962530b87fcb4.webm?t=1754665151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this forgotten realm, where survival meets strategy, engage in combat, crafting, and watch as your camp evolves into a thriving settlement. Along the way, you'll meet companions with unique stories, manage your growing community, and embark on personal quests that shape your journey. Are you ready to build, survive, and uncover the secrets of Highreach? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/1e56d66c7be802989d719be726445974.poster.avif?t=1754665151\" width=800 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/1e56d66c7be802989d719be726445974.webm?t=1754665151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own airship and traverse through a continent of forgotten floating islands. Expand and upgrade your airship with different tech. Make it your flying mobile base, and use it to explore the skies, together with your friends and with settlers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/6d75c3ddf160525c2e108f25411bf893.poster.avif?t=1754665151\" width=800 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/6d75c3ddf160525c2e108f25411bf893.webm?t=1754665151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique combat styles with varied active skills and spells. Specialize your character with shareable items, allowing you to use diverse combat styles and stay flexible in your approach. Progress is shared among your group.\u00a0 Latecomers can simply equip your items, catch up instantly, and jump right into the action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/8f10b0b0977f6b3eb827823d5512b3aa.poster.avif?t=1754665151\" width=800 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/8f10b0b0977f6b3eb827823d5512b3aa.webm?t=1754665151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue survivors of the shattered lands. Gradually expand your settlement into a thriving base. Your settlers will help with tasks like crafting, cooking, and gathering, making survival more manageable. Assign tasks to settlers, manage buildings, and expand your camp. Be sure to meet the needs of your settlers. Proper homes and the right jobs will keep them more than happy to help you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/7e576ce3dfcbaee379a064a88291d3bb.poster.avif?t=1754665151\" width=800 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/7e576ce3dfcbaee379a064a88291d3bb.webm?t=1754665151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors you meet come with their own backstory and personal experiences here in Highreach. Bring them to your encampment and drive the narrative forward with their personal quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/81ff9de32119fbfe58c5a94ce338c75b.poster.avif?t=1754665151\" width=800 height=205 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/81ff9de32119fbfe58c5a94ce338c75b.webm?t=1754665151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a visually captivating, procedurally generated world with diverse biomes connected. Build a network of connections with ziplines or portals for easier traversal. Each area offers new, unpredictable challenges and rewards, making every exploration unique with diverse points of interest. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2620450/extras/a5f009903445c14cd9ec6f7ce8082848.avif?t=1754665151\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Play</strong>: Up to 5 players can join together, with dynamic difficulty scaling based on the group size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settlement Building</strong>: Construct and manage a customizable base with various structures and quality tiers. Use building blueprint placement to quickly deploy entire pre-designed buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settler Professions</strong>: Assign roles like woodcutter, miner, and cook to automate tasks and support the settlement. Customize individual settler tasks within each profession for optimized efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Airships</strong>: Use your mobile airship base to explore the world. Expand and improve it throughout your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat System</strong>: Engage in melee, ranged, and magic combat with dodge, block, and various attack options. Use supportive magic to heal and assist your team in battle and specialize in different types of skills matching your preferred playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven</strong>: Complete main and side quests that reveal settlers' personal stories. Chat with settlers to uncover more about their background and the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Dungeons</strong>: Delve into procedurally generated dungeons filled with unique challenges and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression Through Exploration</strong>: Unlock crafting recipes, building structures, resources, quests, NPCs, and points of interest and new armor tiers by exploring the world and it's secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle</strong>: Dynamic cycle affecting visibility, settler activity, and environmental dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather</strong>: Adapt to changing weather conditions that impact gameplay and survival needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural World</strong>: Explore a procedurally generated world with diverse biomes, points of interest, and environmental challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gatherers</strong>: Collect materials like wood, stone, and ore, with specialized settlers assisting in the process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting</strong>: Create tools, weapons, and equipment using gathered resources at crafting stations, with settlers expanding the crafting capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong>: Manage hunger, thirst, health, stamina, and temperature to stay alive. Consuming food and drinks can provide buffs to health and stamina.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
