tures and quality tiers. Use building blueprint placement to quickly deploy entire pre-designed buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settler Professions</strong>: Assign roles like woodcutter, miner, and cook to automate tasks and support the settlement. Customize individual settler tasks within each profession for optimized efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Airships</strong>: Use your mobile airship base to explore the world. Expand and improve it throughout your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat System</strong>: Engage in melee, ranged, and magic combat with dodge, block, and various attack options. Use supportive magic to heal and assist your team in battle and specialize in different types of skills matching your preferred playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven</strong>: Complete main and side quests that reveal settlers' personal stories. Chat with settlers to uncover more about their background and the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Dungeons</strong>: Delve into procedurally generated dungeons filled with unique challenges and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression Through Exploration</strong>: Unlock crafting recipes, building structures, resources, quests, NPCs, and points of interest and new armor tiers by exploring the world and it's secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle</strong>: Dynamic cycle affecting visibility, settler activity, and environmental dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather</strong>: Adapt to changing weather conditions that impact gameplay and survival needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural World</strong>: Explore a procedurally generated world with diverse biomes, points of interest, and environmental challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gatherers</strong>: Collect materials like wood, stone, and ore, with specialized settlers assisting in the process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting</strong>: Create tools, weapons, and equipment using gathered resources at crafting stations, with settlers expanding the crafting capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong>: Manage hunger, thirst, health, stamina, and temperature to stay alive. Consuming food and drinks can provide buffs to health and stamina.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "When calamity struck, the world of Highreach was shattered. In this open-world survival game, build encampments, rescue survivors, and soar across the skies on your airship to explore a lost world and uncover the truth.",
